<title>USA: Health Care REIT files shelf registration.</title>
<headline>Health Care REIT files shelf registration.</headline>
<dateline>TOLEDO, Ohio 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Health Care REIT Inc said on Thursday that it filed a shelf registration with the Securities and Exchange Commission to offer up to an aggregate of $300 million of securities, which includes common stock, preferred stock and debt.</p>
<p>Health Care REIT, based in Toledo, is a real estate investment trust which invests in health care facilities, primarily nursing homes, assisted living facilities and retirement centers.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
